A floating attribute is scoped to the container that holds it

```
> q
> {.k}

tail
.
<blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
<p>tail</p>
```

```
> q
> {.k}
tail
.
<blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
<p>tail</p>
```

```
- a
  {.k}

tail
.
<ul>
  <li>a</li>
</ul>
<p>tail</p>
```

```
- a
  {.k}
# H
.
<ul>
  <li>a</li>
</ul>
<section id="H">
  <h1>H</h1>
</section>
```

```
:: t
:  d
   {.k}
tail
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>d</dd>
</dl>
<p>tail</p>
```

